+# tvOS port notes (3.27.4 -> 3.41.6)
+
+This document tracks the port of LibertyGlobal's tvOS patch (`tvos-patch.diff`,
+based on `flutter-tvos-engine@3.27.4`) onto upstream Flutter 3.41.6. The patch
+originally touched 39 files across the standalone engine repo; 3.29 merged
+engine into flutter/flutter, so paths shift to `engine/src/flutter/...`.
+
+All commits are on branch `tvos-port` (local only).
+
+## Architectural decisions
+
+1. **DEPS**
+   - 3.41.6 has a top-level `DEPS` at the flutter repo root (monorepo layout).
+     The old `src` buildroot entry no longer exists (buildroot absorbed into
+     the repo), and `perfetto` moved under `dart/third_party`.
+   - We added the `upc_git` / `upc_revision` vars and switched the **dart** and
+     **skia** deps to `LibertyGlobal/flutter-tvos-{dart,skia}@3.27.4`.
+   - Buildroot and perfetto forks are intentionally *not* applied: there is no
+     analogous top-level entry in 3.41.6 and applying them would require
+     restructuring the monorepo layout. Follow-up work: investigate whether
+     LibertyGlobal's buildroot changes are needed at all for tvOS (or whether
+     they were iOS-simulator fixes already landed upstream in 3.41.6).
+   - Known compile risk: the LibertyGlobal forks are pinned at 3.27.4 versions
+     of Dart/Skia, but Flutter 3.41.6 expects newer revisions per the rest of
+     `DEPS`. **Expect API mismatches on first compile; this is a known issue
+     that the user agreed to debug at compile time.**
+
+2. **Impeller Metal backend** (`allocator_mtl.mm`, `context_mtl.mm`,
+   `command_buffer_mtl.mm`, `sampler_library_mtl.mm`): 3.41.6 simplified these
+   files. Most `@available(...)` fallback branches for pre-iOS-13 were removed
+   and direct `supportsFamily:` queries are used. Rather than textually
+   replicating the 3.27.4 patch hunks (which would no-op on missing code), we
+   applied the same **architectural intent**: add
+   `#if !(defined(TARGET_OS_TV) && TARGET_OS_TV)` guards around
+   `supportsFamily:` calls and provide `MTLFeatureSet_tvOS_GPUFamily*_v1`
+   fallbacks for tvOS.
+
+3. **`FlutterPlatformViews_Internal.mm`**: removed in 3.41.6 — the code that
+   was `TouchInterceptingView` + `containsWebView` is now in
+   `FlutterPlatformViews.mm`. Patch applied to that file instead.
+
+4. **`FlutterViewController.mm`** (421-line change): Ported fully. All the
+   Siri-Remote gesture recognizers, GCController + MPRemoteCommandCenter
+   setup, the `sendGamepadTouches:` channel, and the selection overlay
+   injection are now behind `#ifdef TARGET_OS_TV` blocks. iOS paths
+   (UIHoverGestureRecognizer, UIPanGestureRecognizer trackpad setup, pinch &
+   rotation recognizers, keyboard animation system, home indicator, status
+   bar) are wrapped with `#if !(defined(TARGET_OS_TV) && TARGET_OS_TV)`.
+
+5. **Test files** (`*Test.mm`): Each iOS-specific test is guarded
+   individually with `#if !(defined(TARGET_OS_TV) && TARGET_OS_TV)`. The tests
+   are **also disabled at the BUILD.gn level** (all test sources commented
+   out), so the guards are largely defense-in-depth.
+
